  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Zhong Shanshan (Chinese: 钟睒睒; pinyin: Zhōng Shǎnshǎn, born 1954) is a Chinese business magnate and billionaire. He is the founder and chairperson of the Nongfu Spring beverage company and majority owner of Beijing Wantai Biological Pharmacy Enterprise.\nAs of 2025, Zhong has a net worth of US$77.5 billion, and was ranked among the top 25 in the Bloomberg Billionaires Index. His wealth is derived mainly from his business stakes and interests in the Chinese beverage and pharmaceutical industries.",
    "sourceId": "wikipedia-en",
    "usage": "Research excerpt; paraphrase and cross-check before publication."
  },
